     1861   PROCEDURE reposition-query :
     1862       DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER p-requestor-hdl     AS HANDLE NO-UNDO.
     1863       RUN set-attribute-list ('REPOSITION-PENDING = NO':U).
     1864       RETURN.
